# OPTIONAL. The game works with none of this set.
#
# The two PCs find each other over two routes at once, and keep whichever the
# network allows:
#   1. a direct WebRTC connection (fast; introduced by a PeerJS broker)
#   2. a relay over WebSocket Secure (slower, but works almost anywhere)
#
# Set these only if you want to run your own services instead of the free
# public ones — see: npm run broker
#
# VITE_PEER_HOST=192.168.1.42
# VITE_PEER_PORT=9000
# VITE_PEER_SECURE=false
# VITE_PEER_PATH=/
# VITE_RELAY_URL=ws://192.168.1.42:9001/mqtt
